# Plan, then one build phase

This chat burned **~4.5M tokens / 3.21 $** (`grok-4.7-high`, cache **89%**) by planning a Leaderboard in one thread, then shipping core + webview + every locale catalog, then a VSIX, then pasting **Optimize Deep here**. Volume was **context**, not cold cache.

## When the ask is “implement the plan” / “stwórz funkcjonalność”

- The plan file is the handoff. The next Agent message is **one phase**, not the whole plan.
- **Phase 1:** `src/<feature>/` + its Vitest files only.
- **Phase 2:** host + `media/history.*` only when that message names those paths. Do not also rewrite every catalog.
- **Locales:** `en` + `pl` in the wire turn. Other catalogs are the **next** message. A `UiCatalog` type error is not permission to script-patch every locale in the same turn.
- **VSIX / version / CHANGELOG** stay a later short message. Do not bundle them with the first build.

## After a red Warn-at (`!`) in this chat

- Do **not** paste Optimize (Deep) here.
- Do **not** start phase 2, docs, or another feature in this thread.
- Next build slice: **new chat**, goal + ≤5 paths.

## Still allowed

- One phase whose paths are in the user message.
- A later message that is only `npm run package` (one Shell).
